{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>An endless battle against powerful Titans!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this <strong>massively cooperative tower defense game</strong>, terrifying Titans travel from player to player. Every attack you land helps weaken these colossi, and the player who delivers the final blow receives rewards to become even stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build, Upgrade, Survive</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start with walls and a basic turret.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Place your defenses strategically to maximize damage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock and equip increasingly powerful towers through Titan loot.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Unique Economic Ecosystem</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Looted towers are <strong>Steam items</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy turrets and walls with the money earned by attacking the Titans.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each 3h you can loot a tower.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each Titan has a special\u00a0<strong>loot table</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The stronger the Titan, the more valuable its rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Merge towers and get upper guality tower !\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Face Ever-Strong Titans</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Massive monsters with tons of health points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A <strong>pathfinding system</strong> that makes them either go around or destroy your defenses.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Join the battle and leave your mark on the fall of the Titans!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3523390?t=1742489280","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/